'''Summer Break Cats Castaway''' (ねこのなつやすみ サバイバル, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi Sabaibaru'', '''Summer Break Cats Survival''') is the second part of the trilogy Summer event in [[The Battle Cats]], the first part being [[Summer Break Cats Paradise]] and the third part being [[Summer Break Cats]]. Added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]], it later received more content in Version [[Version 14.5 Update|14.5]].

==Event Information==
The worst end to a summer imaginable...<br>
Limited Seasonal Event ★ Summer Break Cats: Castaway<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between August 25th (11:00am) and September 15th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Use Cat Scratcher Cards for a chance at free Cat Food every week!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #1: August 25th (11:00am) until August 30th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #2: September 1st (11:00am) until September 6th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Chance #3: September 8th (11:00am) until September 11th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Visit the Cat Base and tap the {{Color|#3399FF|'''Cat Scratcher'''}} tab to test your luck! Choose one of the three spots, then scratch away to get the prize hidden at that spot!

Scratch once during each chance period to collect a maximum total of {{Color|#FF0000|'''450 Cat Food'''}} over 5 scratches! Check in each week and don't miss out on glorious prizes!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Summer Break Cats: Castaway Limited Stages!'''}}<br>
A castaway Cat fights to survive across multiple special stages!

Visit the Legend Stages during this event to challenge Summer Break Cats: Castaway event stages!<br>
※ If event stages do not appear, please update the app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Available Now: "Summer Break Cats: Castaway"!'''}}<br>
Stranded on a desert island, Cat's only chance for survival is their stockpile of Legend Traps!

Clear stages to collect {{Color|#38761D|'''Legend Traps'''}} as drop rewards, with later stages in the map having higher drop rates!

Build up your Legend Trap reserves and exchange them for food(?) from the Event Capsules!<br>
※After all stage clear attempts have been used, there will be a cooldown period before the stage can be attempted again.<br>
※Cooldown times can be skipped by using a Catamin A item.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''New XP Stage "Unprecedented Forecasts"!'''}}<br>
Mother Nature is unrelenting...!<br>
Clear this stage while it's available at the following times for a chance to earn a huge amount of Legend Traps!<br>
{{Color|#46BDC6|'''"Unprecedented Forecasts" Availability:'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''8/27,8/31,9/4,9/8,9/12 from 11:00AM until 2:59PM.'''}}<br>
{{Color|#9900FF|'''8/25,8/29,9/2,9/6,9/10,9/14 from 6:00PM until 9:59PM.'''}}

Endure the neverending downpour!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Available Week 2: "Jungle Survival"!'''}}<br>
Ride out the rapids as you hunt for food!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between September 1st (11:00am) and September 15th (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stages in this map to claim<br>
{{Color|#6AA84F|'''Legend Traps'''}} and other rewards!

※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''New stage Island Defenders available after week three!'''}}<br>
A chance meeting with an unknown tribe!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between September 8th (11:00am) and September 15th (10:59am)!'''}}

Can you blend in with the unknown tribe enough to be successfully initiated?! Clear all 10 stages to earn you different item rewards from each victory!

※ After clearing a stage from this map, there will be a brief cooldown period before the next gauntlet stage can be accessed.<br>
※ You may choose to spend a Catamin A to skip the cooldown and challenge the next Gauntlet stage immediately.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Summer Break Cats: Castaway Capsules!'''}}<br>
This event will offer players access to limited Event Capsules featuring Summer Break Cats: Castaway event exclusive special heroes, battle items, and XP!<br>
Tap the Event Capsules button at the Cat Base to make a draw and collect awesome rewards!

Collect tons of {{Color|#6AA84F|'''Legend Traps'''}} from special stages and other event features to exchange for chances to get limited Special Units {{Color|#0000FF|'''Sardine'''}}, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Squid'''}}, and {{Color|#0000FF|'''Ancient Egg: N206'''}}, as well as new unit {{Color|#0000FF|'''Tasmanian Giant Crab'''}} and useful battle items, experience, and more!

Collect and use the evolve item Behemoth Stones to evolve Ancient Egg: N206 to its third True Form, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Clam Cat'''}}!

※ Rewards from the Summer Break Cats Castaway Event Capsules can only be received by exchanging Legend Trap items received by clearing Summer Break Cats Castaway stages or from other event-related features.<br>
※ Unused Legend Nets will no longer be useable after the event ends on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Sept 15, 2025 at 11:00AM'''}} and the Event Capsules no longer display.<br>
※ Unused Legend Nets cannot be exchanged for item or XP rewards after the event ends.<br>
※ If Event Capsules do not appear, please update the app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited Missions Available!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards including {{Color|#6AA84F|'''Legend Nets and Rare Tickets'''}} by playing limited-time-only events! More missions will be added as the event continues, so check back in regularly!

※Limited Event Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Castaway Celebration Login Stamp Campaign'''}}<br>
Only during this event, collect limited Login Stamps each with another awesome reward!

By visiting the Cat Base each day during this event, you can collect bonus rewards like {{Color|#0000FF|'''Legend Traps'''}}, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Rare Tickets'''}} and more! Don't miss out!

※ Up to 14 Stamps can be collected.<br>
※ You must update the app to the most recent version to collect login stamps.

