==Trivia==
*The 破天候 ''hatenkō'' in 破天候予報 ''Hatenkō Yohō'' is not an actual word. It is likely a pun on 破天荒 ''hatenkō'' (unheard-of; unprecedented) and 天候 ''tenkō'' (weather).
*During the 2025 run of this event, an 8.8 magnitude earthquake occured on the eastern coast of Russia, resulting in tsunami warnings across countries bordering the northern half of the Pacific ocean. This prompted [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] to retract the [[Media:Picture diary 2025 03 nyanko images.jpg|diary entry]] released on the same day and issue a [https://x.com/PONOS_GAME/status/1950390480220631522 statement] apologizing for the poor timing of it, as an intense storm was coincidentally featured as the main subject of that day's entry. No further entries were released for the remainder of the event.

